    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="1164" n="1150" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg1150"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/9–544: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hayes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-11T21:00:00-04:00">September 11,
                            1944—9 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2518. The following is from War Refugee Board. Reference is made to your 3044 of
                    September 5.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d689-f1"/> Department’s 2331 to Lisbon dated
                    August 24 was limited to rescue activities out of France and does not cover
                    situation in areas still under German control.</p>
                <pb facs="1165" n="1151" xml:id="pg1151"/>
                <p>With regard to Department’s 2361 of August 24<anchor n="2" xml:id="d689-f2"/> to
                    you, while the actual passage of Jews from Hungary and other Axis areas through
                    Spain may perhaps be rendered unnecessary by military developments, neutral
                    visas and permission for unobstructed exit of beneficiaries of such visas are
                    still of great importance in safeguarding the lives of Jews in such areas, and
                    you are requested to continue your efforts in this respect. [War Refugee
                    Board.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d689-f1" n="1" xml:id="d689-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it concerned issuance of Spanish visas to persons in German-occupied
                    territories (840.48 Refugees/9–544).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d689-f2" n="2" xml:id="d689-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; it concerned entrance of refugee children into Spanish Morocco
                    (840.48 Refugees/8–1244).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
